WEBVTT

00:11:29.935 --> 00:11:31.854
This is what he does.

00:11:31.895 --> 00:11:35.232
But I decided to respond,
but not with anger.

00:11:35.274 --> 00:11:38.819
I kind of organized a few comments
and asked him a question.

00:11:39.403 --> 00:11:42.239
"Uncle Frank, I know you.

00:11:42.281 --> 00:11:43.782
I love you.

00:11:43.782 --> 00:11:45.367
I respect you.

00:11:45.367 --> 00:11:49.288
And what I know about you
is that you'd run into a burning building

00:11:49.288 --> 00:11:52.040
and save somebody if you could.

00:11:52.040 --> 00:11:55.169
And you wouldn't care
what race that person is,

00:11:55.210 --> 00:11:58.046
you wouldn't care whether
they were gay or an immigrant.

00:11:58.756 --> 00:12:02.050
So, Uncle Frank, that's the man
I love and respect.